00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:13.880
active in the Caribbean or in domestic remote community work should extract the procurement templates

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:19.060
and interconnection approaches that proved most resilient. They often prove more applicable than

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:25.040
